<title>BELGIUM: Highlights of Wednesday's Commission briefing.</title>
<headline>Highlights of Wednesday's Commission briefing.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following are the highlights of the European Commission's midday briefing on Wednesday:</p>
<p>The Commission released the following documents:</p>
<p>- IP/96/931: Kodak-Fuji case - EU to join the WTO/GATT panel.</p>
<p>- IP/96/934: Commissioner van den Broek on visit in Poland.</p>
<p>- Speech 96/248: Speech by Commissioner Edith Cresson in Bonn.</p>
<p>- ME96/16.10: Midday express.</p>
</text>
